      "id": "linux",
      "title": "Linux 宿主内核漏洞需优先排查",
      "titleId": "linux-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Red Hat 更新 CVE-2026-98432 指引：IPv4 TCP 处理存在可被远程未认证攻击者利用的释放后使用漏洞。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "RHEL、OpenShift 管理者应核查受影响版本并更新内核；过滤特定报文只是临时缓解，不能替代修补。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-02",
      "dateLabel": "11月2日 · 指引更新",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "Red Hat 官方公告",
          "url": "https://access.redhat.com/security/vulnerabilities/RHSB-2026-016",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "actions",
      "title": "GitHub 高风险 PR 工作流限制延期",
      "titleId": "actions-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "公有仓库 pull_request_target 默认封禁改至12月2日；11月9日、16日16:00–18:00 UTC先进行两次临时执行测试。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "维护者应检查受影响工作流，避免届时突然失败；私有、内部仓库及GHES不受影响。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-02",
      "dateLabel": "11月2日 · 公告",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
          "label": "GitHub 变更说明",
          "url": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-02-pull_request_target-blocked-by-default-december-2/",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "longcat",
      "title": "LongCat-2.5 API 开放使用",
      "titleId": "longcat-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "官方更新日志列出原生视觉理解、复杂代码库和长程工程任务支持，并提供Claude Code、Codex等接入方式。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "编程Agent多了一个可测试后端，实际可靠性仍需用自己的项目验证；这里确认的是API可用，并非开放权重。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-02",
      "dateLabel": "11月2日 · 发布",
      "eventDate": null,
      "sourcePublishedAt": null,
      "sources": [
        {
