          "url": "https://github.blog/changelog/2026-11-02-security-risk-assessments-include-repository-protection-status/",
          "icon": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "workload",
      "title": "Workload Map 统一描述 AI 集群任务",
      "titleId": "workload-title",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "NVIDIA展示如何用YAML统一描述JobSet、Ray等Kubernetes任务，让调度和管理工具复用同一套结构定义，减少逐框架编写解析器。",
          "variant": ""
        },
        {
          "text": "该Apache 2.0组件已用于Run:ai生产环境；它不是当天首次发布，也不是单机推理加速工具。",
          "variant": "takeaway"
        }
      ],
      "sourceDate": "2026-11-02",
